<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title><%= pageTitle %></title>
<meta name="description" content="<%= metaDescription %>">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/hardware.css">
<link rel="icon" href="/images/favicon.ico">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Products &amp; Services</span>
    <h1>Hardware Procurement</h1>
    <p>Mobility and IT procurement and equipment lifecycle management.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Schedule an obligation-free chat</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-head__copy">
        <h2>Hardware as a Service (HaaS) / Device as a Service (DaaS)</h2>
        <p>Technology should enable your business to move faster — not tie up capital or create ongoing management headaches. Business ICT offers Hardware as a Service (HaaS) and Device as a Service (DaaS) solutions that allow your organisation to access the latest business technology through a simple, predictable monthly model.</p>
        <p>Instead of purchasing devices outright and managing their lifecycle internally, our HaaS model bundles hardware procurement, deployment, support and lifecycle management into one streamlined service. Your team receives the devices they need, while we handle the logistics, refresh cycles and end-of-life management.</p>
        <p>This approach ensures your workforce always has access to reliable, up-to-date technology without large upfront capital investments.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="subsection-head">
      <div><h3>The HaaS Lifecycle</h3></div>
    </div>

    <ul class="lifecycle-steps">
      <li><h4>Procure &amp; Configure</h4><p>Devices are sourced and staged with your business configuration ready to go.</p></li>
      <li><h4>Deploy</h4><p>Ready-to-deploy devices are rolled out to your team with minimal downtime.</p></li>
      <li><h4>Support &amp; Manage</h4><p>Ongoing asset management and tracking across the full fleet.</p></li>
      <li><h4>Refresh &amp; Retire</h4><p>Predictable refresh cycles, with secure device retirement and disposal.</p></li>
    </ul>

    <div class="subsection-head">
      <div><h3>What's Included</h3></div>
    </div>

    <ul class="checklist-grid">
      <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Laptops, desktops and workstations</li>
      <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Business mobile devices and tablets</li>
      <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Docking stations, monitors and accessories</li>
      <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Device staging and configuration</li>
      <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Asset management and tracking</li>
      <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Predictable refresh cycles (typically 36&ndash;48 months)</li>
      <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Secure device retirement and disposal</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="benefits-panel" style="margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);">
      <h2>Why Businesses Choose HaaS</h2>
      <ul class="benefits-list">
        <li><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Predictable monthly costs instead of large capital outlays</li>
        <li><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Technology stays current with planned refresh cycles</li>
        <li><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Reduced IT workload with procurement and lifecycle managed for you</li>
        <li><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Faster onboarding for new employees with ready-to-deploy devices</li>
        <li><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Improved security through managed device lifecycle and retirement</li>
      </ul>
      <p>By partnering with Business ICT for Hardware as a Service, your organisation benefits from a fully managed device lifecycle, improved cost predictability and a workforce equipped with the tools they need to perform at their best.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
